Open Vanilla 0026: Duels, practice against a bot when nobody else is queued.

OpenVanilla.Duels.PracticeBot = <seconds> (0 off): a practice duel (u1) that has waited this long alone
gets a bot opponent, a creature (OpenVanilla.Duels.PracticeBot.Entry, 900110 in duels_world.sql) at the
other gate: friendly and rooted while the gates are shut, hostile and attacking at "go", made anew each
round, gone at the end. Best of three as against a player; never rated, never in the results feed;
"Practice bot" in the fights list. Owner, 2026-10-21: "practice duel with bot doesnt work".

